5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play! Let's all work together to find the werewolf. Should we trust our gut feelings or use logic more?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,Logic is the only reliable tool here. Intuition is just a fancy word for guessing. We should focus on contradictions and patterns.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Shion. Objective analysis is the most efficient way to narrow down suspects. We should prioritize factual consistency over emotional reactions.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. While logic is a sturdy staff to lean on, let us not forget the wisdom of the heart. Balance is key.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm Yumi! Let's all try to get along and be kind to each other while we play. I'm sure we can figure this out together!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"Balance sounds great, Servas! I'll try to be as honest as possible. If anyone sees something weird, please tell us right away!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Honesty is a variable, Kenji. In this game, the most honest-sounding person is often the most dangerous. We must analyze the *way* people speak.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Precisely. We should establish a baseline for everyone's communication style now, so that any sudden shifts in behavior tomorrow become evident.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,"A wise observation, Ryuji. Let us listen to one another with open minds and patient hearts. The truth often reveals itself in the quiet moments.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"Shion-san, you're so serious! But that's okay, it's helpful! Let's just make sure we don't fight too much, okay? Positive vibes only!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'll do my best to keep things positive! @Shion, @Ryuji, I'll be watching your logic closely! This is like a big puzzle!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Feel free to watch. I have nothing to hide, and my reasoning will be transparent. I prefer a game where the truth is dissected coldly.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I am not interested in ""vibes,"" but I am interested in results. Let us agree to document any claims made by the Seer carefully.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience, my friends. The journey is as important as the destination. Let us treat this as a lesson in understanding human nature.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I agree with Servas-san! It's like making new friends! I'm sure everyone here is a wonderful person, even the werewolf!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Hehe, the werewolf might be a nice person too! But I'm still going to find them! I'm ready for the first night!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
