33,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Everyone, wake up! I have some really important news! I'm the Seer, and I checked Shion... and Shion is the werewolf!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shion,,"How convenient. A bold claim right at the start to seize control of the narrative. Kenji, your ""intuition"" is acting up, or you're a very poor liar.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, that is a very aggressive opening. If you are the Seer, you've provided a direct target. @Shion, how do you respond to this accusation logically?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Servas,,"A storm has arrived quickly. Let us breathe and consider this carefully. Kenji, your conviction is strong, but is it based on truth or a desire to lead?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no! Already? I'm sure there's a mistake! Kenji-kun, are you really sure? Shion-san seems so focused, I can't imagine them being the bad guy!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm super sure! The divination doesn't lie! Shion is definitely the werewolf! We have to stop them now before anyone else gets hurt!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shion,,"If I were the werewolf, would I really be this obvious? Kenji is likely the werewolf or the Possessed, attempting to frame me to secure an early win.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, if you are the Seer, you have the most power. @Shion, if you are human, you are the victim of a lie. The contradiction is absolute.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"When two paths diverge so sharply, we must look at the spirit of the speaker. Kenji is eager; Shion is cold. Neither is inherently deceptive.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Yumi,,It's so sad that we're arguing! Maybe we should think about this more? I don't want us to execute someone who is actually a good person!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"But if we don't vote for Shion, the werewolf will just attack us tonight! Please trust me! I want to save everyone!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Trust is for children, Kenji. Logic dictates that a fake Seer is the most common strategy for a werewolf to eliminate a threat. You are too desperate.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, your desperation is noted. @Shion, your defense is standard. However, if Kenji is the werewolf, he has risked everything by claiming Seer so early.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, a risky gambit. But let us remember that the Possessed also seeks to protect the wolf. We must consider if a third party is guiding this.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji-san, you're always so thoughtful! I think we should be careful. What if Kenji-kun is just confused? Let's not be too hasty!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not confused! I'm the Seer! Please, everyone, let's just vote for Shion! I'll prove I'm telling the truth by who survives!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shion,,A classic fallacy. Survival does not prove the source of the information. I suggest we execute the one creating the most chaos: Kenji.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"The risk of keeping a werewolf is higher than the risk of executing a villager. If Kenji is the Seer, Shion must go. I will follow the evidence.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It is time to decide. While my heart wavers, the safety of the village requires a choice. Let us act with courage and hope for wisdom.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I really don't like this... but if everyone thinks so... I'll just go with the flow! I hope we're doing the right thing!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
